span> Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 14 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  14  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-1df47cc547ab9dc9END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-1370cdfea72421efEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_UNI_MOO_ElderBrainDomination</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_UNI_MOO_ElderBrainDomination\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_UNI_MOO_ElderBrainDomination\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">45f3f881-b546-429c-8c93-975116213952</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:45f3f881-b546-429c-8c93-975116213952\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:45f3f881-b546-429c-8c93-975116213952\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Beneath the loose planks in <a href=\"/wiki/Moonrise_Towers#Ketheric's_room\" title=\"Moonrise Towers\">Ketheric's Room</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Moonrise_Towers\" title=\"Moonrise Towers\">Moonrise Towers</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-170&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-167</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Confidential: Dictated to Scribe Yanthus by General Kethric\n</p><p><br>\nYoung <a href=\"/wiki/Enver_Gortash\" title=\"Enver Gortash\">Gortash's</a> plan to enslave an illithid elder brain and make it our marionette under control of the <a href=\"/wiki/Crown_of_Karsus\" title=\"Crown of Karsus\">Crown of Karsus</a> has proceeded almost without flaw, barring the slight delay while our <a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal\" title=\"Bhaal\">Bhaalist</a> allies sorted out their leadership conflict. The weak point must surely be the sharing of the <a href=\"/wiki/Netherstone\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Netherstone\">Netherstones</a> - it was necessary to secure my engagement and that of the murder cult, but eventually it's certain to fracture our fragile alliance. Clearly, all three Netherstones must be controlled by a single leader - me, by preference - but not until after all the stakeholders have made their essential contribution. Gortash fears that, energised by the dark energies of the Crown, the brain we now call the <a href=\"/wiki/Absolute\" title=\"Absolute\">Absolute</a> will eventually metamorphose into something new and more difficult to control. If he's right, the need to invest the power of the Netherstones in a single wielder is urgent. Even more so in that Enver Gortash, at least, must be thinking the same way.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202646\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.058 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.068 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1604/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 33775/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 10954/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.012/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 930521/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   52.679      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   52.679      1 -total\n 53.74%   28.310      7 Template:Icon_text\n 47.54%   25.042     17 Template:Trim\n 19.08%   10.053      2 Template:Uid\n 13.82%    7.279      2 Template:Icon_link\n 13.18%    6.944      1 Template:Main_only\n 12.82%    6.753      1 Template:Ifexist\n 10.78%    5.678      2 Template:Template_style\n  9.77%    5.146      1 Template:Books\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:21615-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202646 and revision id 319233. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}